    "collapsible_content_nJrYmE": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_1": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "How long is each session?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>The routine is designed around simple 10-minute guided sessions, which makes it easier to fit into mornings or evenings.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_2": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "How often should I use it?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Consistency matters more than intensity. Most people use it as part of a regular daily routine so the process feels easy to repeat.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_3": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "What makes it different from eye creams alone?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Traditional creams can be hard to stay consistent with and usually rely on manual application alone. This device is positioned as a more structured at-home ritual with red light, EMS, and soothing heat in one step.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_4": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Can I use it with my normal skincare routine?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Many people use the device as part of their existing routine and then continue with the skincare products they already like using.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_5": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Is it travel friendly?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>The lightweight design and USB-C charging make it easier to pack, recharge, and keep the routine going while traveling.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_6": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "How do I charge it?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>The device charges via USB-C. Recharge it as needed and keep it ready for your normal routine.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_7": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Is this page medical advice?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>No. The EMS & Red Light Eye Massager is presented here as a home-use wellness and beauty device, and this page is for general product information only.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
